      "writtenOn": "2017-09-26T00:58:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "build_targets and docker_image_prereqs is redundant with the scenario. Removed.\n\ncopy_cord_prereqs is needed to create/copy an ssh key from the config to head node to work around password-auth SSH \n\nskipTags is MaaS... something?  I\u0027m not up on what they\u0027re all for, and it\u0027s not best practice. \n\nThe inventory_groups creates the genconfig/inventory.ini file, which is the mapping of ansible groups to hosts.  Needed until we can come up with a better options.",
